From 6373f9b8aad1276c9cd7e99a1df7f4ff93d2ab95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@soprasteria.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:45:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Borg: count Banishment scrolls in the home score

The home score rewards Scrolls of Banishment through num_genocide, but
nothing ever counted them: the scroll scan only counted Mass Banishment.
The reward was always zero, so the Borg never kept a Banishment scroll in
the home. Count them.

Tracked as diegoami/neo-angband-tracker#54.

(cherry picked from commit e49ab94809d6f18d0b1d155ff2b1bc6ba8d3db78)
---
 src/borg/borg-home-notice.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-home-notice.c b/src/borg/borg-home-notice.c
index 4f45ff184..dca4ff18e 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-home-notice.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-home-notice.c
@@ -737,6 +737,8 @@ static void borg_notice_home_aux(borg_item *in_item, bool no_items)
                 num_teleport_level += item->iqty;
             else if (item->sval == sv_scroll_recharging)
                 num_recharge += item->iqty;
+            else if (item->sval == sv_scroll_banishment)
+                num_genocide += item->iqty;
             else if (item->sval == sv_scroll_mass_banishment)
                 num_mass_genocide += item->iqty;
 
-- 
2.53.0

